cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use LigandFF, please cite the technical report below, together with the CGenFF force field and the CGenFF
  algorithm papers (Vanommeslaeghe et al. 2010, 2012a, 2012b; Croitoru et al. 2025). LigandFF is CGenFF-compatible;
  it is not the official CGenFF program.
title: "LigandFF: CGenFF-compatible atom typing, charge assignment and parameter assignment by analogy"
type: software
